 "notes": "Groundwater-flow modeling report. Recorded reported (not simulated) hydraulic properties from table 1 and measured heads; simulated 2050 scenario heads, water budgets, pumping tables and pilot-point calibration values were not recorded. Aquifer-to-formation pairings read across the fig. 4 chart are flagged inferred; the chart text is garbled so geologic units/ages were not recorded as units. Production wells 1-6 have SCDHEC IDs but no stated locations; not recorded.\nPacket holds model limitations, summary (simulation results, not recorded) and references. Recorded the South Carolina hydrogeology references; skipped general modeling/software references (Doherty, Harbaugh, Pollock, Heath), web data pages, precipitation/climate sources, EPA guidelines, O'Reilly (Florida) and Aiken and Kuniansky.",
